s, with static worksharing for target tiles and position updates and an implicit force-to-update barrier.\", \"Process four targets together, preload their coordinates, and apply OpenMP SIMD across target lanes while preserving each target's original ascending source-body accumulation order.\", \"Use a generic body-count threshold to avoid creating a multi-thread team for small inputs; the same loops remain a serial fallback when OpenMP pragmas are ignored.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"7b7f3c684ef2404b\", \"role\": \"A\", \"commit\": \"71d59ca8e1d6b5e3be82955a130bec10070439f6\", \"mean_seconds\": 0.6000779895111918, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/nbody.c\"], \"retained\": [\"Reordered the force calculation into four-target tiles with a shared source-position load per j iteration, retaining ascending j accumulation separately for each target.\", \"Kept a scalar remainder loop for body counts not divisible by four and preserved the binary input/output paths.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"f6b0f61a362748f4\", \"role\": \"A\", \"commit\": \"68d7be52eabac6b5aff41195dd8576a894ba7cd6\", \"mean_seconds\": 0.660605356718103, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/nbody.c\"], \"retained\": [\"Copy positions into contiguous x, y, and z arrays and use those arrays for force calculations, reducing the inner-loop working set while retaining the binary Body format.\", \"Cache each target body's coordinates before the inner loop and keep source bodies traversed in ascending j order.\", \"Integrate positions in the SoA arrays and copy them back to Body once after all simulation iterations.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"28447c7e970d424f\", \"role\": \"B\", \"commit\": \"58304221b391880f582c3d787a4db866db90f576\", \"mean_seconds\": 0.6608000537380576, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/nbody.c\"], \"retained\": [\"Added a GCC ivdep hint to the outer body_force loop so the compiler can vectorize independent target-body iterations without asserting independence for the reduction over j.\"]}}, {\"id\": \"6faa31fd1fff452f\", \"role\": \"B\", \"commit\": \"3d1676daee898b62dfa51dce99b7b35079127903\", \"mean_seconds\": 0.6612155142550667, \"transformations\": {\"files\": [\"src/nbody.c\"], \"retained\": [\"Unpack positions and velocities into six contiguous arrays once, run all iterations using those arrays, and repack the original Body layout for output.\", \"Pass the disjoint state arrays as restrict-qualified pointers and retain the legal outer-loop GCC ivdep hint; keep the inner j loop and arithmetic sequence unchanged.\"]}}]}, \"target_as_data\": {\"architecture\": \"ARM64\", \"cpu_cores\": 4, \"gpus\": 0}, \"required_schema\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"properties\": {\"analysis\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"A\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"B\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"C\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"G\": {\"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"analysis\", \"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"G\"]}}"
